# STYVEX — client-safe (public) environment variables ONLY.
# Never put service role keys, database passwords, or any server secret here or in any committed file.
# Server secrets live in the Lovable secret manager / hosting environment.
#
# NOTE: With Lovable Cloud connected, VITE_SUPABASE_URL, VITE_SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY,
# and VITE_SUPABASE_PROJECT_ID are auto-injected into the real .env at build/runtime.
# You do NOT need to fill these in manually. This file exists only as documentation
# of which public vars the app expects.

VITE_SUPABASE_URL=
VITE_SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=
VITE_SUPABASE_PROJECT_ID=
